@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333
@idCliente = 9

### Mensagem inicial
GET {{baseUrl}}/api
Accept: application/json

### Listar clientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cliente
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cliente
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nome": "João Martins",
  "cpf": "3242421245"
}

### Atualizar cliente (altere @idCliente para um ID existente)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cliente/{{idCliente}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nome": "JOÃO MARTINS ATUAL",
  "cpf": "3242421245"
}